        <mxCell id="note" value="Why hybrid + rerank?&#10;• BM25 alone: misses paraphrase ('hyperlipidemia' vs 'high cholesterol').&#10;• Dense alone: misses rare clinical tokens (LOINC codes, drug names) and is sensitive to query phrasing.&#10;• RRF fuses both robustly without tuning weights; rerank promotes the chunks that actually answer the query." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=12;align=left;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
